msgid "About Nuance Vocalizer for NVDA"
msgstr "Sobre Nuance Vocalizer ta NVDA"

msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to remove your license?\n"
"This can not be reverted."
msgstr ""
"Yes seguro que quiers sacar a tuya licencia?\n"
"Isto no puet revertir-se."

